{"overview":"ادی براک پس از پشت سر گذاشتن ماجراجویی‌های پرزد و خورد با ونوم و همچنین باقی گذاشتن تکه‌ای از این موجود بیگانه، حال بازگشته تا با تهدیدی بسیار وحشتناک دست و پنجه نرم کند. تهدیدی که این بار ساکنین مرگبار سیاره ونوم را بر سرش خراب کرده است. تهدیدی بسیار خطرناک و غیرقابل تصور که به نظر می‌رسد پایان کار او و ونوم را رقم خواهد زد…","tagline":"تا زمانی که مرگ آنها را از هم جدا کند","overview_en":"Eddie and Venom are on the run. Hunted by both of their worlds and with the net closing in, the duo are forced into a devastating decision that will bring the curtains down on Venom and Eddie's last dance.","tagline_en":"'Til death do they part.","runtime":109,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Kelly Marcel"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"تام هاردی","role":"Eddie Brock / Venom","photo":"/d81K0RH8UX7tZj49tZaQhZ9ewH.jpg","en":"Tom Hardy"},{"name":"چیویتل اجیوفور","role":"Strickland","photo":"/kq5DDnqqofoRI0t6ddtRlsJnNPT.jpg","en":"Chiwetel Ejiofor"},{"name":"جونو تیمپل","role":"Dr. Teddy Paine","photo":"/vwCjlWQLQWbmcUT2Lwn9G0O8r2.jpg","en":"Juno Temple"},{"name":"ریس ایفانز","role":"Martin","photo":"/5X8XcIqCDxsQYyHdx7mBwPVkSTs.jpg","en":"Rhys Ifans"},{"name":"استیون گراهام","role":"Detective Mulligan","photo":"/yguEO9zFvuccq87kOJpFLsmUgvs.jpg","en":"Stephen Graham"},{"name":"Peggy Lu","role":"Mrs. Chen","photo":"/ng5eaDcOf9kSwIYGNmwF9wEfIHp.jpg"},{"name":"Clark Backo","role":"Sadie","photo":"/d24KKFxfoql6PBsBPsejFgzhSlH.jpg"},{"name":"آلانا اوباک","role":"Nova","photo":"/ffyBAEoW3bDgVJQV3GaHsZ9x29W.jpg","en":"Alanna Ubach"},{"name":"کریستو فرناندس","role":"Barman","photo":"/irx5BVVLSQWY9m5NrhqyxPekwIY.jpg","en":"Cristo Fernández"},{"name":"Jared Abrahamson","role":"Captain Forrest","photo":"/3hShByAdCj1Qom9mXeeqJL9zu8d.jpg"},{"name":"Hala Finley","role":"Echo","photo":"/9tU0kFjCGNiEe55KAxXkExBVMPC.jpg"},{"name":"Dash McCloud","role":"Leaf","photo":"/8WmRoUrM5S7rA0TVSdKGOSh9uq8.jpg"}],"trailer":"FKBN1qAzW3s","watch":{"US":{"li